window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-045-6b717d128902439d.json"]={sha256:"6b717d128902439da4b0856973fc6649e951fc01b857c166a4d69677fa6fb1af",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-2d71d80dc2237864","url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/security/identity-protection/credential-guard/","title":"Credential Guard overview","titleEn":"Credential Guard overview","publisher":"Microsoft","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-045","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-045","related":[{"id":"security-v26-046","referenceUrls":["https://support.apple.com/guide/deployment/intro-to-filevault-dep82064ec40/1/web/1.0","https://support.apple.com/guide/security/hardware-security-overview-secf020d1074/web"],"title":"Apple FileVault：開機保護與復原金鑰治理","titleEn":"Apple FileVault: boot protection and recovery-key governance","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：85%與95%可回溯逐台證據，兩台例外仍列明；未宣稱它保護所有種類的秘密或取代其他控制。 交付40台合成狀態清單、例外處置與登入相容性回歸表。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Trace 85% and 95% to per-device evidence and retain two exceptions; do not claim coverage of every secret type or replacement of other controls. Deliver a synthetic 40-device status inventory, exception disposition and login-compatibility regressions.","difference":"為虛構Mac資產分列平台類型、FileVault狀態、核准使用者與復原金鑰託管驗證；不要把硬體本身的儲存加密當成已啟用使用者保護。","differenceEn":"Separate platform type, FileVault state, authorized users and recovery escrow verification for fictional Macs; do not equate inherent hardware storage encryption with enabled user protection.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["可驗證覆蓋率=確認執行且通過相容性測試的裝置/範圍裝置；這是部署證據比例，不是可防止所有憑證攻擊的機率。 40台範圍裝置中34台有執行與相容性證據，6台仍待處理。 34/40×100=85%；補修4台後38/40×100=95%。","可驗證管理覆蓋=同時符合加密政策與復原託管證據的裝置/範圍裝置；兩者缺一都不能算完整。 200台教學Mac中180台同時具政策與託管驗證，其餘20台缺一項。 180/200×100=90%；補修10台後190/200×100=95%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Verified coverage is devices running the feature and passing compatibility tests divided by in-scope devices; this is deployment evidence, not universal credential-attack prevention probability. Of 40 in-scope devices, 34 have runtime and compatibility evidence and six remain pending. 34/40×100=85%; repairing four gives 38/40×100=95%.","Verified management coverage is devices meeting both encryption policy and recovery-escrow evidence divided by in-scope devices; either missing part is incomplete. Of 200 teaching Macs, 180 have both policy and escrow evidence and 20 lack one requirement. 180/200×100=90%; completing ten yields 190/200×100=95%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-055","referenceUrls":["https://codeql.github.com/docs/writing-codeql-queries/"],"title":"CodeQL：資料流路徑與人工分流","titleEn":"CodeQL: data-flow paths and evidence triage","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：85%與95%可回溯逐台證據，兩台例外仍列明；未宣稱它保護所有種類的秘密或取代其他控制。 交付40台合成狀態清單、例外處置與登入相容性回歸表。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Trace 85% and 95% to per-device evidence and retain two exceptions; do not claim coverage of every secret type or replacement of other controls. Deliver a synthetic 40-device status inventory, exception disposition and login-compatibility regressions.","difference":"為每個結果保留來源到輸出的路徑，判斷驗證是否支配所有可達分支，避免僅數警告。","differenceEn":"Retain source-to-sink paths and determine whether validation covers every reachable branch rather than just counting alerts.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["可驗證覆蓋率=確認執行且通過相容性測試的裝置/範圍裝置；這是部署證據比例，不是可防止所有憑證攻擊的機率。 40台範圍裝置中34台有執行與相容性證據，6台仍待處理。 34/40×100=85%；補修4台後38/40×100=95%。","分流工作量=候選路徑數×每條檢查分鐘；結果去重需保留不同來源或不同控制缺口。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 查詢產生18條路徑，其中6條是同一來源與輸出對的重複展示；每條人工檢查4分鐘。 需審查12條唯一候選，預估12×4=48分鐘。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Verified coverage is devices running the feature and passing compatibility tests divided by in-scope devices; this is deployment evidence, not universal credential-attack prevention probability. Of 40 in-scope devices, 34 have runtime and compatibility evidence and six remain pending. 34/40×100=85%; repairing four gives 38/40×100=95%.","Triage effort equals candidate paths times minutes per path; deduplication must preserve distinct sources or control gaps. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. A query produces eighteen paths, six duplicate presentations of the same source-sink pair; each unique path requires four minutes. Twelve unique candidates require an estimated 12×4=48 minutes.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-d225c9ae6a5805c0","url":"https://support.apple.com/guide/deployment/intro-to-filevault-dep82064ec40/1/web/1.0","title":"Apple: Intro to FileVault","titleEn":"Apple: Intro to FileVault","publisher":"Apple","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-2e81006c3bcff072","url":"https://support.apple.com/guide/security/hardware-security-overview-secf020d1074/web","title":"Apple Platform Security: Hardware security overview","titleEn":"Apple Platform Security: Hardware security overview","publisher":"Apple","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-6c0c13fca98291ab","url":"https://codeql.github.com/docs/writing-codeql-queries/","title":"Writing CodeQL queries","titleEn":"Writing CodeQL queries","publisher":"GitHub","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
